Spec: SpecDD Section Documentation Registry

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Load and render help text for known SpecDD section labels.

Owns:
  SpecDDSectionDocumentation.kt
  ../../../../../resources/ai/specdd/idea/documentation/sections.txt

Can modify:
  SpecDDSectionDocumentation.kt
  ../../../../../resources/ai/specdd/idea/documentation/sections.txt

Can read:
  ../parser/*
  ../../../../../../test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/documentation/SpecDDSectionDocumentationBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Provide one documentation entry for every known SpecDD section label.
  Keep documentation useful for novice SpecDD users while staying technical.
  Load section documentation text from the packaged resource file.
  Render documentation as IntelliJ-compatible HTML.
  Escape section label and description text before rendering HTML.
  Render blank-line-separated documentation text as paragraphs.
  Return no documentation for unknown labels.

Must not:
  Define parser classification behavior.
  Define validation diagnostics.
